{
  "file": "module6",
  "page": 54,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.38239288330078,
        527.4442138671875,
        87.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "to inform the 2019 WHO ARV drug guidelines update, with the safety of DTG examined among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.4199829101562,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "people with both TB and HIV. No deaths were reported in either arm (DTG versus efavirenz), and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.399169921875,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "there were fewer severe adverse events in the DTG arm (odds ratio: 0.61, 95% CI: 0.17–2.24), with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.4189453125,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "low-certainty evidence  . The REALITY trial among people with advanced HIV disease included  (110)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4215698242188,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "raltegravir as an additional option and also did not find any increased incidence of IRIS  .  (104)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.3914794921875,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "However, close follow-up is advisable to monitor IRIS and other clinical events requiring prompt",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        527.4475708007812,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "assessment and management, especially among children and pregnant or breastfeeding women.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.4146728515625,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "HIV programmes and service providers should establish mechanisms for adequate monitoring,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        403.9461975097656,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "including pharmacovigilance and surveillance for drug-drug interactions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.428955078125,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "The review did not identify any studies that included pregnant and breastfeeding women. However,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        527.4422607421875,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "the GDG noted that earlier ART was unlikely to increase harm in this population, and the well-known",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        527.4267578125,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "and demonstrable benefits of earlier ART for both the mother’s health and the child’s health, with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.4173583984375,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "reduced vertical transmission of HIV, outweighed potential harm  . Evidence was also limited  (21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        524.4346923828125,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "regarding the timing of ART for those with drug-resistant TB and those receiving second- and third-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        159.07949829101562,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "line ART regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.27239990234375,
        489.3269958496094,
        325.62738037109375
      ],
      "text": "Timing of ART initiation for people living with HIV diagnosed with drug-resistant TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.4091186523438,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Evidence was reviewed from 10 studies   to assess treatment outcomes when ART and  (111-120)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.4234619140625,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "second-line TB drugs were used together. None of the data were from RCTs. Individual participant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4276123046875,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "data were available for 217 people with drug-resistant TB in total, of whom 127 received ART. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        503.2596740722656,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "level of evidence in individual observational studies varied from a low- to a very low-certainty.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.4454345703125,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The pooled individual participant data from longitudinal cohort studies showed a lower risk of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.3926391601562,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "death and a higher likelihood of cure and resolution of TB signs and symptoms in individuals using",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.4430541992188,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "ART compared with those not using ART (low-quality evidence). There is very low-quality evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.3947143554688,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "for other outcomes that were considered critical or important for decision-making (for example,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.3980712890625,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "severe adverse effects from second-line drugs for DR-TB, occurrence of sputum smear or culture",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.4103393554688,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "conversion, interactions of ART with TB drugs and default from treatment). Available data did not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        527.4354248046875,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "allow assessment for a number of other outcomes of interest, namely, avoiding the acquisition of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.41455078125,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "additional drug resistance, preventing TB transmission, sustaining relapse-free cure, establishing the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.4265747070312,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "optimal duration of MDR-TB treatment, avoiding unnecessary MDR-TB treatment, reducing cost and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        299.01934814453125,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "improving population access to appropriate care.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.2064819335938,
        517.7376708984375,
        563.62744140625
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 30: Co-trimoxazole prophylaxis for people living with HIV with diagnosed TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.4200439453125,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Co-trimoxazole is a fixed-dose combination of two broad-spectrum antimicrobial agents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.4190063476562,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "(sulfamethoxazole and trimethoprim) that prevents a range of secondary bacterial, fungal and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4244384765625,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "protozoan infections. People living with HIV who also have TB disease should receive co-trimoxazole",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.3848876953125,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "regardless of CD4 count. Evidence from RCTs, including areas with high levels of antibiotic resistance,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.4179077148438,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "has shown reduced mortality, morbidity and hospitalization with no significant increase in adverse",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.3882446289062,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "events among people living with HIV who have smear-positive TB, regardless of their CD4 counts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.4234619140625,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": ". Other non-randomized and operational studies showed that co-trimoxazole preventive  (121, 122)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.3823852539062,
        482.8440856933594,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "therapy is feasible  , safe and reduces mortality rates in people with TB  .  (123, 124) (123, 125)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.2064208984375,
        492.5311584472656,
        703.6273803710938
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 31: ART initiation in TB treatment settings and linkages to HIV care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.3823852539062,
        527.4003295898438,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Coordination between TB and HIV programmes to deliver comprehensive and uninterrupted care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.3823852539062,
        527.4255981445312,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "for TB and HIV is important for the individual in need of care. It can also reduce out-of-pocket costs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.3823852539062,
        527.4304809570312,
        745.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "related to travelling to multiple appointments  . Community engagement, patient education,  (126)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.8661003112793,
        801.2599487304688,
        51.10609817504883,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "36",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        801.2599487304688,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.4364013671875,
        801.2599487304688,
        170.0603790283203,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
